        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, barge</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, barge
The ship is painted 10 times in its entire life span (40 yrs) . The consumption of lubricates is included in the fuel consumption for vessel operation.;
UUID: 53684ee6-1fbd-3d61-b08d-0484fb1afc63
This inventory includes the use of paint and emissions of the solvent of the paint as NMVOC. Consumption of lubricates are excluded.
Location: Europe
Technology: unknown
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature studies and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_53684ee6-1fbd-3d61-b08d-0484fb1afc63.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
